; `#use-reader-macros "."` names a directory, which the reader opened and
; sized with ftell -- LONG_MAX on glibc -- and aborted on the wrapped arena
; request (fuzz-manifest-deadly-signal-2026-10-19).  The input libFuzzer
; found is tests/fuzz/seeds/fuzz_manifest/use-reader-macros-directory-oom.bin.
; The diagnostic differs by platform -- "is not a regular file" where fopen
; opens a directory (glibc, macOS), "cannot open" where it does not (MinGW)
; -- so only the prefix is pinned.
#use-reader-macros "."
(defn main [] : int 0)
